a('## 1. The corpus')
a('\nThe operator approved the reviewed Step 2 tables and use of the documented NIED-listed 2018 edition on 31 October. This settles our working-source decision; there is no separate NIED statement confirming 2026 applicability. The publisher and local syllabus have identical extracted text and all 52 page images match at 144 dpi. The Paper 1 duration discrepancy was explicitly waived as a non-major, non-blocking issue. Neither question is reopened as an approval gate.\n')
